  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In an octagon <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>H</mi></math>&nbsp;of equal side, what is the sum of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;if, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>AO</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0076_82373a9c4cf3.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 189px;\" /></p>"
