  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>OA</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OB</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OC</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OD</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OE</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OF</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OG</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OH</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p>By triangle law of vector addition, we can write</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>AB</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>AO</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OB</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>;</mo><mover><mi>AC</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>AO</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OC</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>AD</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>AO</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OD</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>;</mo><mover><mi>AE</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>AO</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OE</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>AF</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>AO</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OF</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>;</mo><mover><mi>AG</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>AO</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OG</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>AH</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>AO</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OH</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p>Now</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>AB</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>AC</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>AD</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>AE</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>AF</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>AG</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>AH</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mover><mi>AO</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OB</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OC</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OD</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OE</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OF</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OG</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>OH</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mover><mi>AO</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>OA</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mover><mi>AO</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>AO</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mover><mi>AO</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>32</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p>"
